    {
      "source": "The <code>McpHints</code> class provides GraalVM native image hints for MCP schema classes.\nThis class automatically registers all necessary reflection hints for MCP schema classes when building native images.",
      "translation": "`McpHints` 类为 MCP 模式类提供 GraalVM 原生镜像提示。在构建原生镜像时，该类会自动注册所有必要的反射提示以支持 MCP 模式类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The MCP utilities provide foundational support for integrating Model Context Protocol with Spring AI applications.\nThese utilities enable seamless communication between Spring AI’s tool system and MCP servers, supporting both synchronous and asynchronous operations.\nThey are typically used for programmatic MCP Client and Server configuration and interaction.\nFor a more streamlined configuration, consider using the boot starters.",
      "translation": "MCP 工具为将模型上下文协议（Model Context Protocol）集成到 Spring AI 应用中提供了基础支持。这些工具实现了 Spring AI 工具系统与 MCP 服务器之间的无缝通信，同时支持同步和异步操作。它们通常用于程序化地配置和交互 MCP 客户端与服务器。若需更简化的配置方式，建议使用启动器（boot starters）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Adapts MCP tools to Spring AI’s tool interface with both synchronous and asynchronous execution support.",
      "translation": "适配 MCP 工具以符合 Spring AI 的工具接口，同时支持同步和异步执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Discovers and provides MCP tools from MCP clients.",
      "translation": "发现并提供来自 MCP 客户端的 MCP 工具。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For dynamic selection of a subset of clients",
      "translation": "用于动态选择客户端子集",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Converting Spring AI tool callbacks to MCP tool specifications:",
      "translation": "将 Spring AI 工具回调转换为 MCP 工具规范：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Getting tool callbacks from MCP clients",
      "translation": "从 MCP 客户端获取工具回调",
      "count": 1
    },
